---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import SectionDivider from "../components/SectionDivider.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Disclaimer | Divine Health Homeopathy"
  description="Read the Divine Health Homeopathy website disclaimer regarding educational information, homeopathic services, medical care, external resources, individual results, and personal responsibility."
>
  <main>
    <section class="legal-hero">
      <div class="legal-hero-inner">
        <p class="eyebrow">Important Information</p>

        <h1>Disclaimer</h1>

        <SectionDivider />

        <p class="legal-intro">
          The information provided by Divine Health Homeopathy, LLC through this
          website is intended to help visitors learn about classical homeopathy,
          its history and principles, and the services offered by Divine Health
          Homeopathy.
        </p>

        <p class="updated">
          Last updated: August 2026
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="legal-section">
      <div class="legal-container">

        <section class="legal-block">
          <h2>Educational Information — Not Medical Advice</h2>

          <p>
            Divine Health Homeopathy provides information about classical
            homeopathy for educational and informational purposes. Content on
            this website, including information about homeopathic remedies,
            symptoms, health conditions, research, historical material,
            articles, resources, and other educational content, should not be
            interpreted as medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment.
          </p>

          <p>
            Mindy Wallent is a Classical Homeopath, in training, and is not a
            licensed physician. Homeopathic consultations and recommendations
            provided through Divine Health Homeopathy are not a substitute for
            care from a licensed medical professional.
          </p>

          <p>
            You should consult your physician or another appropriately licensed
            healthcare professional regarding medical symptoms, diagnoses,
            treatment decisions, medications, or other medical concerns. Do not
            delay seeking medical care, discontinue prescribed medication, or
            alter a medical treatment plan based upon information provided on
            this website or during a homeopathic consultation.
          </p>

          <p>
            If you believe you are experiencing a medical emergency, seek
            appropriate emergency medical care immediately.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-block">
          <h2>Classical Homeopathic Services</h2>

          <p>
            Classical homeopathy is an individualized approach in which a
            person's physical, mental, emotional, and characteristic symptoms
            are considered when selecting a homeopathic remedy.
          </p>

          <p>
            Homeopathic consultations provided through Divine Health Homeopathy
            are intended to complement, rather than replace, appropriate
            licensed medical care. Recommendations made during a homeopathic
            consultation should not be understood as medical diagnoses,
            prescriptions, or directions to discontinue or modify medical
            treatment.
          </p>

          <p>
            Clients remain responsible for maintaining an appropriate
            relationship with their physicians and other licensed healthcare
            professionals.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-block">
          <h2>Individual Results and No Guarantees</h2>

          <p>
            Every person and every case is different. Divine Health Homeopathy
            does not promise or guarantee that the use of homeopathy, a
            particular remedy, consultation, educational resource, or other
            information provided through this website will produce a particular
            health outcome.
          </p>

          <p>
            Descriptions of homeopathic principles, historical uses, clinical
            experiences, research findings, or individual experiences should
            not be interpreted as guarantees that another individual will
            experience the same result.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-block">
          <h2>Personal Responsibility</h2>

          <p>
            You are responsible for decisions concerning your own health and the
            health of children or other individuals for whom you are legally
            responsible.
          </p>

          <p>
            Information obtained through this website should be considered in
            light of your individual circumstances and, when appropriate,
            discussed with a qualified healthcare professional. Your use of
            information from Divine Health Homeopathy is voluntary and does not
            transfer responsibility for your healthcare decisions to Divine
            Health Homeopathy or Mindy Wallent.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-block">
          <h2>Children and Minors</h2>

          <p>
            Information on this website may discuss the use of classical
            homeopathy with infants, children, and adolescents. Such information
            is educational and does not replace pediatric or other licensed
            medical care.
          </p>

          <p>
            A parent or legal guardian must participate in homeopathic
            consultations involving minors and remains responsible for
            obtaining appropriate medical evaluation and treatment when
            necessary.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-block">
          <h2>Research and Scientific Information</h2>

          <p>
            Divine Health Homeopathy may provide links to or discuss published
            research, historical medical literature, homeopathic texts, and
            other scientific or educational resources. Such material is
            provided to encourage learning and informed consideration of
            homeopathy.
          </p>

          <p>
            The inclusion of a study, publication, historical source, or
            research finding does not imply that its conclusions are universally
            accepted, applicable to every individual, or sufficient to establish
            that a particular treatment is appropriate for you.
          </p>

          <p>
            Information concerning the voluntary use of anonymized client
            information for research is addressed separately in our
            <a href="/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a> and applicable
            research consent materials.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-block">
          <h2>External Links and Resources</h2>

          <p>
            This website may contain links to organizations, publications,
            educational materials, research databases, professional resources,
            products, or other third-party websites.
          </p>

          <p>
            These links are provided for convenience and education. Unless
            specifically stated otherwise, their inclusion does not constitute
            an endorsement of every statement, product, service, opinion, or
            practice of the organization or website being linked to.
          </p>

          <p>
            Divine Health Homeopathy does not control third-party websites and
            is not responsible for their content, privacy practices,
            availability, or accuracy.
          </p>

          <p>
            If Divine Health Homeopathy uses affiliate links in the future,
            those relationships will be disclosed where appropriate.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-block">
          <h2>Accuracy of Information</h2>

          <p>
            Considerable care is taken in researching and preparing the
            educational material presented on this website. Nevertheless,
            information may change as research develops, publications are
            updated, regulations change, or new information becomes available.
          </p>

          <p>
            Divine Health Homeopathy cannot guarantee that every piece of
            information will remain complete, current, or free from inadvertent
            errors. Historical information and quotations are presented from the
            sources identified whenever practicable.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-block">
          <h2>Testimonials and Individual Experiences</h2>

          <p>
            If testimonials, case experiences, or personal accounts are
            presented on this website, they describe the experiences of
            particular individuals. They should not be interpreted as a
            promise, prediction, or guarantee that another person will
            experience the same outcome.
          </p>

          <p>
            Individual responses to homeopathic care vary.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-block">
          <h2>Limitation of Liability</h2>

          <p>
            To the extent permitted by applicable law, Divine Health
            Homeopathy, LLC and Mindy Wallent are not responsible for losses or
            damages resulting from reliance upon educational information
            provided through this website or from the use or misuse of
            information obtained through third-party resources linked from this
            website.
          </p>

          <p>
            Nothing in this Disclaimer is intended to waive rights or
            responsibilities that cannot lawfully be waived or limited.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-block">
          <h2>Nondiscrimination</h2>

          <p>
            Divine Health Homeopathy is committed to treating clients with
            dignity and respect and does not discriminate in the provision of
            its services on the basis of race, color, national origin, age,
            disability, sex, or any other status protected by applicable law.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-block legal-contact">
          <h2>Questions</h2>

          <p>
            Questions regarding this Disclaimer or the services provided by
            Divine Health Homeopathy may be directed to:
          </p>

          <p>
            <strong>Divine Health Homeopathy, LLC</strong><br />
            Mindy Wallent<br />
            <a href="mailto:Mindy@DivineHealthHomeopathy.com">
              Mindy@DivineHealthHomeopathy.com
            </a><br />
            <a href="tel:+17347676085">(734) 767-6085</a>
          </p>
        </section>

      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  main {
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .legal-hero {
    padding: 86px 40px 82px;

    background:
      radial-gradient(
        circle at top,
        #fffdf8 0%,
        #f6eee1 58%,
        #eadbc6 100%
      );

    text-align: center;
  }

  .legal-hero-inner {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 16px;

    color: var(--gold);
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.34em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  h1,
  h2 {
    color: var(--navy);
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 0 0 26px;

    font-size: clamp(3.4rem, 6vw, 5.1rem);
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .legal-intro {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 30px auto 0;

    color: #40516a;
    font-size: 1.17rem;
    line-height: 1.84;
  }

  .updated {
    margin: 24px 0 0;

    color: #756b5c;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .legal-section {
    padding: 92px 40px 112px;

    background: #fffdf9;
  }

  .legal-container {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .legal-block {
    padding: 0 0 46px;
    margin: 0 0 46px;

    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(184, 154, 94, 0.24);
  }

  .legal-block:last-child {
    padding-bottom: 0;
    margin-bottom: 0;

    border-bottom: 0;
  }

  .legal-block h2 {
    margin: 0 0 20px;

    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.35rem);
    line-height: 1.15;
  }

  .legal-block p {
    margin: 0 0 18px;

    color: #4a596f;
    font-size: 1.04rem;
    line-height: 1.82;
  }

  .legal-block p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .legal-block a {
    color: var(--navy);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration-color: rgba(184, 154, 94, 0.65);
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .legal-block a:hover {
    color: var(--gold);
  }

  .legal-contact {
    padding: 34px;

    background:
      radial-gradient(
        circle at top,
        #fffaf3 0%,
        #f5ead9 100%
      );

    border: 1px solid #dfd0b7;
    border-radius: 24px;

    box-shadow:
      0 16px 42px rgba(16, 35, 63, 0.07);
  }

  @media (max-width: 650px) {
    .legal-hero {
      padding: 62px 20px 64px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 3.15rem;
    }

    .legal-intro {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
    }

    .legal-section {
      padding: 68px 20px 82px;
    }

    .legal-block {
      padding-bottom: 36px;
      margin-bottom: 36px;
    }

    .legal-block p {
      font-size: 1rem;
      line-height: 1.75;
    }

    .legal-contact {
      padding: 26px 22px;
    }
  }
</style>